<title>CANADA: Romarco up on rumors.</title>
<headline>Romarco up on rumors.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romarco Minerals Inc jumped  on takeover rumors on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shares in the Toronto-based gold exploration company were up C$0.60 to C$6.25 by midday in trading of more than 400,000 shares.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the company denied the rumors were true.</p>
<p>Romarco has been exploring property in Nevada next to the Midas project owned by Franco-Nevada Mining Corp Ltd and Euro-Nevada Mining Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
